<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov tin exports slip 6.2 pct yr-on-yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov tin exports slip 6.2 pct yr-on-yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought tin and tin alloys slumped to 32,150 tonnes in the first 11 months of this year, down 6.2 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Tin exports were 5,013 tonnes in November alone.</p>
<p>China exported 34,298 tonnes of tin in the first 11 months of 1995, the figures showed.</p>
</text>
